!!omap
  - id: F036
  - function: DisplayReservationCard
  - range:
      - 693
      - 705
  - args:
      - ReservationPtr Reservation
  - return: void
  - requirement: !!omap
      - trigger: ''
      - action: ''
      - effect: ''
      - constraint: ''
  - code: "void DisplayReservationCard(ReservationPtr Reservation)\n{\n  printf(\"\
      \\n______________________________\\n\");\n  printf(\" - ID: %d\", Reservation->ID);\n\
      \  printf(\"\\n - User ID: %d\", Reservation->UserID);\n  printf(\"\\n - Room
      ID: %d\", Reservation->RoomID);\n  printf(\"\\n - Date: %02d/%02d/%d\",\n  \
      \       Reservation->Date.Day, Reservation->Date.Month, Reservation->Date.Year);\n\
      \  printf(\"\\n - Time: %02d:%02d - %02d:%02d\",\n         Reservation->Start_Time.Hour,
      Reservation->Start_Time.Minute,\n         Reservation->End_Time.Hour, Reservation->End_Time.Minute);\n\
      \  printf(\"\\n______________________________\\n\");\n}\n"
  - description: 
      この関数は、予約情報を受け取り、その詳細（ID、ユーザーID、部屋ID、日付、開始時間と終了時間）をフォーマットしてコンソールに表示します。
